    "title": "DeepSeek's launch of new AI model delayed by Huawei chip issues, FT reports - NewsBreak",
    "text": "(Reuters) -Chinese artificial intelligence company DeepSeek has delayed the release of its new model after failing to train it using Huawei's chips, highlighting the limits of Beijing's push to replace U.S. technology, the Financial Times reported on Thursday. (Reporting by Disha Mishra in Bengaluru)",
